          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Karnataka Plans AI and Deeptech Innovation Centres in Tier-II and Tier-III Cities Beyond Bengaluru",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Karnataka's State Planning and Policy Commission has proposed a roadmap to decentralise the state's technology ecosystem by establishing Karnataka Innovation Orchestration Centers in tier-II and tier-III cities, moving beyond Bengaluru's dominant tech corridor. The plan targets deeptech incubation, applied AI research, and R&D activity in smaller urban centres as part of a strategy to make Karnataka a global model for technology-driven inclusive development. The initiative follows growing concern that Bengaluru's saturation is limiting India's broader tech expansion.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/state-planning-commission-pitches-tech-ecosystem-push-beyond-bengaluru-to-tier-ii-iii-cities/articleshow/131017782.cms",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
